<title>CHINA: China Jan-Oct rice exports soar 724.4 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Oct rice exports soar 724.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's rice exports reached 240,000 tonnes in the first 10 months of this year, up 724.4 percent from the year-ago period, the Futures Herald quoted customs figures as saying on Monday.</p>
<p>Rice exports in October were 30,000 tonnes. It gave no comparative figures for the month alone.</p>
<p>China's rice imports dropped 5.4 percent to 540,000 tonnes in the first 10 months compared with the year-ago period, the figures showed.</p>
<p>Imports in October alone were 50,000 tonnes. There were no comparative figures for October.</p>
</text>
